      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a730ad19ec7de593676cbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "模仿狄俄尼索斯，让所有人\n陷入酩酊的刹那……那就是西西弗斯的陡山。\n我将来要为迷途羔羊提供的新世界（吧台）！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6ea5b487e728c9472dfab3f083f8b8e0aba931ea210ffc4070fb7aceaa58a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60c3fcb1bf3e911c77f05755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷水琴蕾",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f369ca4b88e8e1e112bbdc6350fea562c8b217773a6c67f202a3296b773c9d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
