    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d35f7e4751910ba2023064",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我再次喝了一口手中的无酒精琴蕾。\n青柠刺激的香气涌入鼻腔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "915766244a467ecf80519faed091f6b5333a55ff8faf25675d7a240bd7b2724e",
